  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The number of terminal oxygen atoms present in the product <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> obtained from the following reaction is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeCr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Na</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math></p>"
  },
